Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.02,0:02:00.03,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,うるわしの君がだんだん近くなった
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.03,0:02:02.28,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,その肌に触れてしまえるか？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.28,0:02:05.99,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,くれよ真夏みたいな雷鳴　遅れて伝う鼓動
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.99,0:02:10.08,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,揺さぶってくれよtick-tackでいざなって　たまにいろはを
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.08,0:02:15.04,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,放棄して　無謀をして　抱きしめてね　なんちゃって
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.72,0:02:26.26,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,眩しさにスイッチ押されたってさ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.72,0:02:31.43,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,その犯人は太陽？それとも水たまりの月？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.27,0:02:36.86,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,辞書に書いてるその意味だけで恋を知った気になるだなんてさ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.86,0:02:39.86,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,なんか勿体無いって思いません？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.15,0:02:45.32,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,凪に慣れたりそわそわしたり　あれ？大なり君の温度
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.32,0:02:49.83,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,想像が積もりて謎も積もりて　なぜ？小なり君の形
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.83,0:02:55.25,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,近づけば近づくほど増える　煌めきを彩る言葉の数々
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.46,0:02:57.33,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,まだ目が離せないよ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.29,0:03:02.26,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,うるわしの君がだんだん近くなった
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.26,0:03:04.55,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,その肌に触れてしまえるか？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.55,0:03:08.18,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,くれよ真夏みたいな雷鳴　遅れて伝う鼓動
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.18,0:03:12.56,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,揺さぶってくれよtick-tackでいざなって　たまにいろはを
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.56,0:03:17.35,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,放棄して　無謀をして　抱きしめてね　なんちゃって
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.90,0:03:22.65,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,「だから月夜で待ってる」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.49,0:03:25.57,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,一回しか言わないよ。
Comment: 0,0:01:29.00,0:01:29.00,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.02,0:02:00.03,OPEDCH,,0,0,0,,美麗的你漸漸地靠近了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.03,0:02:02.28,OPEDCH,,0,0,0,,能夠觸碰到那肌膚嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.28,0:02:05.99,OPEDCH,,0,0,0,,給我吧 宛如盛夏般的雷鳴 延遲傳達的心跳
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.99,0:02:10.08,OPEDCH,,0,0,0,,動搖我吧 隨著滴答聲引導 有時將基礎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.08,0:02:15.04,OPEDCH,,0,0,0,,拋棄掉 魯莽行事 緊緊擁抱我 說笑的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.72,0:02:26.26,OPEDCH,,0,0,0,,即使被那份耀眼按下了開關
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.72,0:02:31.43,OPEDCH,,0,0,0,,兇手是太陽 還是水窪裡的月亮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.27,0:02:36.86,OPEDCH,,0,0,0,,僅僅靠著字典裡的含義 就以為了解戀愛這回事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.86,0:02:39.86,OPEDCH,,0,0,0,,不覺得有點太可惜了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.15,0:02:45.32,OPEDCH,,0,0,0,,習慣了平靜又或是忐忑不安 咦 你的溫度大於一切
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.32,0:02:49.83,OPEDCH,,0,0,0,,想像不斷堆積 謎團也不斷堆積 為什麼 你的輪廓小於期待
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.83,0:02:55.25,OPEDCH,,0,0,0,,越是靠近就越多 點綴這份閃耀的無數話語
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.46,0:02:57.33,OPEDCH,,0,0,0,,視線還是無法移開喔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.29,0:03:02.26,OPEDCH,,0,0,0,,美麗的你漸漸地靠近了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.26,0:03:04.55,OPEDCH,,0,0,0,,能夠觸碰到那肌膚嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.55,0:03:08.18,OPEDCH,,0,0,0,,給我吧 宛如盛夏般的雷鳴 延遲傳達的心跳
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.18,0:03:12.56,OPEDCH,,0,0,0,,動搖我吧 隨著滴答聲引導 有時將基礎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.56,0:03:17.35,OPEDCH,,0,0,0,,拋棄掉 魯莽行事 緊緊擁抱我 說笑的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.90,0:03:22.65,OPEDCH,,0,0,0,,「所以我在月夜下等著你」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.49,0:03:25.57,OPEDCH,,0,0,0,,我只會說一次喔
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.57,0:22:22.69,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\shad0\3c&H000000&}白日、心のヒビにふと気づく
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.26,0:22:32.22,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\shad0\3c&H000000&}その隙間からこぼれてしまった運命動脈　地球儀を吶々とまわす
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.56,0:22:39.51,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\shad0\3c&H000000&}どこだろう？砂糖菓子みたいに甘やかに漂える場所
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.92,0:22:44.83,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\shad0\3c&H000000&}まだ気づかないでね　気づかないフリをしててね
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.05,0:22:53.05,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\shad0\3c&H000000&}あなたが掴めなくて　掴めそうな　不可思議に答えが欲しい
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.05,0:23:00.75,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\shad0\3c&H000000&}神様に問いかけても　ゆっくりと流れるだけの飛行機雲
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.75,0:23:04.79,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\shad0\3c&H000000&}触れ合ってしまった指が偶然じゃないと信じて
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.79,0:23:08.06,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\shad0\3c&H000000&}もう一度って月に願ってみたり
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.49,0:23:16.10,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\shad0\3c&H000000&}自分の心は自分が一番わかってない　恥ずかしくなるよな
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.10,0:23:22.25,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\shad0\3c&H000000&}また一つあなたの言葉を知れたけれど　胸には刻まずに
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.25,0:23:29.97,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\shad0\3c&H000000&}もう少し遠回りをしたくなるの　アザレアの風の中で
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.75,0:23:32.42,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\shad0\3c&H000000&}見つめてる
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.42,0:23:36.90,OPEDJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\shad0\3c&H000000&}ごめんね、もう少しだけ。
Comment: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.57,0:22:22.69,OPEDCH,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\shad0\3c&H000000&}白晝裡，猛然察覺內心的裂痕
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.26,0:22:32.22,OPEDCH,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\shad0\3c&H000000&}從那縫隙中悄然流逝的命運動脈 訥訥地轉動著地球儀
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.56,0:22:39.51,OPEDCH,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\shad0\3c&H000000&}在那裡呢？那個能如糖果般甜美飄蕩的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.92,0:22:44.83,OPEDCH,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\shad0\3c&H000000&}請還不要發現喔 請假裝沒有察覺吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.05,0:22:53.05,OPEDCH,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\shad0\3c&H000000&}對於那觸不可及、卻又似能觸碰的不可思議 我想要一個答案
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.05,0:23:00.75,OPEDCH,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\shad0\3c&H000000&}即便向神明渴求詢問 也只有飛機雲在悠然流轉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.75,0:23:04.79,OPEDCH,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\shad0\3c&H000000&}深信著彼此相觸的指尖並非偶然
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.79,0:23:08.06,OPEDCH,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\shad0\3c&H000000&}試著向月亮許願 祈求能再有一次機會
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.49,0:23:16.10,OPEDCH,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\shad0\3c&H000000&}最不了解自己內心的竟然是自己 真是讓人感到羞愧啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.10,0:23:22.25,OPEDCH,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\shad0\3c&H000000&}雖然又多了解了一句你的話語 卻不想將它刻在心底
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.25,0:23:29.97,OPEDCH,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\shad0\3c&H000000&}想在杜鵑花盛開的風中 再稍微繞點遠路
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.75,0:23:32.42,OPEDCH,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\shad0\3c&H000000&}凝視著你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.42,0:23:36.90,OPEDCH,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\shad0\3c&H000000&}對不起，請再讓我停留這一下下。
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.22,0:00:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我完全沒發現
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.25,0:00:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,是說…從什麼時候開始的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.65,0:00:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是覺得你是個可愛的女孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.59,0:00:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那你有喜歡的人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.57,0:00:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.33,0:00:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,慘了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.84,0:00:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是那個意思
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.61,0:00:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,大路
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.60,0:00:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,那個 如果你剛才說的是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.33,0:00:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 過去一直都沒有顧慮到你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.47,0:00:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,還有 如果你說的是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.55,0:01:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我沒有辦法回應你的心意
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.10,0:01:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,真的很對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.39,0:01:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.32,0:01:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我早就猜到你會這麼說了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.96,0:01:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你這一點也是我喜歡的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.27,0:01:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我們還是跟以前一樣當個好同事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.39,0:01:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.55,0:01:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣…真的好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.01,0:01:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,唉…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.73,0:01:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我被甩了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.33,0:03:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.02,0:03:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.04,0:03:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,芳子 你不是在瑞士嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.35,0:03:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿嘿 現在是暑假
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.03,0:03:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿嘿你個頭
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.30,0:03:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎麼找到我的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.22,0:03:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,阿姨跟我說的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.40,0:04:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那個老太婆
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.02,0:04:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,講話真難聽 你最差勁了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.34,0:04:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我難得回日本 你卻不在家 琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.46,0:04:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我只好自己來找你囉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.70,0:04:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,喔 真是謝謝你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.10,0:04:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,掰啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.91,0:04:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.49,0:04:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,有你這樣對待好久不見的青梅竹馬的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.44,0:04:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,音量超過六十分貝的人一律不准進門
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.11,0:04:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼 你是說我很吵嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.95,0:04:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,才沒有那回事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.10,0:04:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我很文靜的 要是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.45,0:04:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.99,0:04:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼都沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.36,0:04:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,好無聊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.84,0:04:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我先說清楚 我這裡連飲料也沒有喔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.46,0:04:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,平常都沒人來你家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.82,0:04:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,聽說沒人來的家裡 運氣會停滯不前喔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.31,0:04:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,真希望她快點回去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.19,0:04:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 對了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.77,0:04:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你今天可以陪我吃飯嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.55,0:04:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,蛤
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.85,0:04:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你說
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.13,0:04:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,之前跟朋友去吃飯 店裡的店員超帥的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.31,0:04:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,今天還想再去一次 但自己一個人去有點尷尬 你知道吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.83,0:05:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,所以想說你陪我一起去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.98,0:05:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.74,0:05:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.35,0:05:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,拜託啦 你又不會少一塊肉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.79,0:05:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,還能飽餐一頓耶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.92,0:05:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,好麻煩
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.76,0:05:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你找那個朋友去不就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.51,0:05:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,才不要
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.81,0:05:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,要是跟女生去 我可不希望她也喜歡上對方
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.73,0:05:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,如果找男生朋友 又會變得很麻煩
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.65,0:05:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我才想找一個對我完全沒興趣的人去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.02,0:05:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,真的好希望她快點回去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.52,0:05:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我現在有女朋友了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.80,0:05:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.01,0:05:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼 又交新的了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.23,0:05:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你換女友的速度也太快了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.38,0:05:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,真搞不懂你們這些受歡迎的男生
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.66,0:05:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,反正你到頭來 還是會跟她分手的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.48,0:05:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,吃頓飯又沒什麼關係
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.60,0:05:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不會跟她分手
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.90,0:05:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.72,0:05:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,琥珀竟然在鬧彆扭 好可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.84,0:05:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,以前的他都會笑著打哈哈過去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.32,0:05:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,原來他也有孩子氣的一面
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.04,0:06:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,欸 你現在的女朋友是怎樣的人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.28,0:06:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼 為什麼問
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.94,0:06:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,沒什麼 只是想知道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.49,0:06:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,怎樣的人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.01,0:06:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,很認真卻有點少根筋
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.74,0:06:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,很容易害羞 馬上就會滿臉通紅
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.65,0:06:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,有點老派又很固執 有時候又像少年漫畫的主角
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.70,0:06:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,有時候又大膽到 連我都覺得有點可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.42,0:06:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然我之前說她「很美」
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.94,0:06:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,但越是了解她
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.55,0:06:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,就越覺得她有很多難以捉摸的一面
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.06,0:06:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,很難用言語拼湊出完整的樣貌
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.50,0:06:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,她喜歡吃甜的 特別是紅豆沙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.42,0:06:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你的詞彙量真是少得可憐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.82,0:06:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,那這樣好了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.06,0:06:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,只要你陪我去吃飯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.93,0:06:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我就告訴你一家很好吃的甜點店
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.93,0:06:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,算了 這招對你沒用吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.58,0:06:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼 真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.14,0:06:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.82,0:07:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,芳子 你真是個好人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.77,0:07:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,謝啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.77,0:07:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.50,0:07:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,好 我去換個衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.36,0:07:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,剛…剛才是什麼表情
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.00,0:07:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,除了剛才鬧彆扭的表情
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.09,0:07:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,這個琥珀跟我認識的完全不一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.94,0:07:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,以前問他女朋友是怎樣的人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.04,0:07:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不記得了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.42,0:07:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,他都會這樣毫無興趣地回答
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.69,0:07:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,居然會記得她喜歡吃甜的 這點就很了不起了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.84,0:07:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,他的新女友到底有多可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.33,0:07:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 我好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.68,0:07:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord0\b1\fs96\c&HD9E2EB&\3c&H4675BB&\pos(963.999,420)}茄子老爹咖哩
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.72,0:07:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord0\b1\fs78\c&HD9E2EB&\3c&H4675BB&\pos(978,308.001)}茄子老爹咖哩
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.76,0:07:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord0\b1\fs60\c&HD9E2EB&\3c&H4675BB&\pos(980.001,248.001)}茄子老爹咖哩
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.80,0:07:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord0\b1\fs48\c&HD9E2EB&\3c&H4675BB&\pos(984,206.001)}茄子老爹咖哩
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.85,0:07:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord0\b1\fs45\c&HD9E2EB&\3c&H4675BB&\pos(992.001,180)}茄子老爹咖哩
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.89,0:07:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord0\b1\fs42\t(0,2750,\fs40.5)\c&HD9E2EB&\3c&H4675BB&\move(992.001,171.999,993.999,168,0,2734)}茄子老爹咖哩
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.64,0:07:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,喔 原來你說的店是這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.67,0:07:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.40,0:07:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你看 你看 那邊就是我說的帥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.77,0:07:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,這麼說來
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.25,0:07:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,芳子好像很喜歡成熟大叔型的演員
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.96,0:07:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 我的心臟快停了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.24,0:08:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\b1\fs30\c&HF0F7FC&\3c&H4675BB&\frx6\fry342\frz7.48\pos(1388.001,72)}茄子老爹咖哩
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.62,0:07:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不是還有另外兩個帥哥嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.24,0:07:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,咦 有嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.27,0:08:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,看來你眼裡只有你感興趣的人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.49,0:08:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.63,0:08:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.41,0:08:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,反正也能見到宵
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.40,0:08:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,歡迎光臨
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.50,0:08:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 今天也來吃咖哩嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.34,0:08:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,咦 今天宵不在嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.49,0:08:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 她今天休息
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.22,0:08:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,咦 真的假的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.07,0:08:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,真不巧啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.68,0:08:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,她朋友哭著拜託她 所以她去幫忙寫作業了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.50,0:08:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 那位是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.75,0:08:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…那個 我是…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.94,0:08:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 她只是我的青梅竹馬
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.51,0:08:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 是這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.78,0:08:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,那今天也請好好享用吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.82,0:08:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.10,0:08:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,來了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.97,0:08:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 剛剛是怎樣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.30,0:08:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你認識他嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.75,0:08:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 算是吧 他是我女朋友的爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.40,0:08:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fade(88,0)\b1\fs120\pos(960,14.001)}爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.40,0:08:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.92,0:08:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.97,0:08:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,小聲點
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.63,0:08:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,可是…可是如果他有小孩的話
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.41,0:09:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,那我就完全沒機會了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.30,0:09:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.72,0:09:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你先選個咖哩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.43,0:09:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,朋友哭著拜託她 所以就請假了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.33,0:09:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,如果換作是我哭著拜託她 她會不會也請假呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.23,0:09:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,要是被宵看到這個情況不太好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.61,0:09:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,當時我什麼都不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.56,0:09:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,還跟宵說了些鼓勵她跟那個人在一起的話
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.86,0:09:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不對 這不關我的事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.47,0:09:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,啊～吃得好飽
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.89,0:09:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,芳子 你吃很多耶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.82,0:09:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我這是化悲憤為食量
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.37,0:09:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 抱歉 有電話
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.05,0:09:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你先幫我付一下 我等一下再還你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.43,0:09:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.99,0:09:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\b1\fs48\c&H3B4138&\pos(948,105.999)\frz344.5}我在便利商店前面等
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.99,0:09:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\b1\fs48\c&H3A4245&\pos(278.001,216)\frz345.3}好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.99,0:09:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\b1\fs48\c&H2D352E&\pos(910.002,753.999)\frz343.7}你還醒著嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.16,0:10:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\b1\fs60\c&H343B3E&\pos(430.002,662.001)\frx6\fry354\frz346.2}作業寫完了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.26,0:10:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣會很噁心嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.58,0:10:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\b1\fs48\c&H2D352E&\frz343.7\pos(1008.003,426)}你還醒著嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.58,0:10:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord0\b1\fs48\c&HE5F0DF&\3c&H8EA448&\pos(630.003,801.999)\frx2\fry0\frz343.8}已刪除訊息
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.99,0:10:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我不習慣傳訊息 不知道一般人都聊什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.34,0:10:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,總共是三千圓
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.94,0:10:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,刷卡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.07,0:10:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 對了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.77,0:10:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以先去你家嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.73,0:10:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,蛤
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.96,0:10:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我忘了東西
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.02,0:10:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,請給我鑰匙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.95,0:10:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,芳子 你不要鬧了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.58,0:10:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.31,0:10:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,這傢伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.29,0:10:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你這傢伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.22,0:10:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是該再誠實一點
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.31,0:10:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是很喜歡這個人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.10,0:11:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.99,0:11:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.87,0:11:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你明明有女朋友 還跟別的女生吃飯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.31,0:11:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不對 我好像也沒資格說他
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.53,0:11:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,總之 宵知道這件事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.35,0:11:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你是指芳子的事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.40,0:11:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我們之間才不是那種關係
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.01,0:11:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,而且這也跟你沒關係吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.69,0:11:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,他說得沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.62,0:11:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,怎樣 你是喜歡宵嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.01,0:11:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我已經…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.60,0:11:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,告訴她我的心意了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.57,0:11:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.76,0:11:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你那是什麼意
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.86,0:11:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.09,0:11:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你家在哪個方向啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.02,0:11:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我一個人找不到路啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.69,0:12:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,芳子 你真是…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.20,0:12:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 你付完錢了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.31,0:12:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我們回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.57,0:12:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,等…喂
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.57,0:12:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.05,0:12:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,多謝款待
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.66,0:12:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝光臨
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.58,0:12:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 對了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.04,0:12:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,剛才打電話來的朋友 告訴我一家很好吃的甜點店…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.50,0:12:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,咦 你怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.07,0:12:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我已經告訴她我的心意了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.82,0:12:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.11,0:12:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我到底…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.90,0:12:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,在幹嘛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.17,0:12:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,總覺得自己漸漸變成一個很差勁的人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.70,0:12:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 大路
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.34,0:12:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我們來排一下你下學期的班表吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.75,0:12:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.29,0:13:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,開學典禮早晨的陽光好刺眼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.15,0:13:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,很高興我們能活著迎接這一天
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.94,0:13:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,全都是託宵大人的福
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.85,0:13:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你們這樣會妨礙到別人 快住手
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.09,0:13:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,真的是託你的福 宵
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.79,0:13:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我還以為作業永遠寫不完了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.07,0:13:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,對啊對啊 你是我們的救命恩人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.90,0:13:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好啦好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.15,0:13:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,寒假我可不幫你們囉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.21,0:13:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.38,0:13:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.83,0:13:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,她們真的有在反省嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.54,0:13:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不過 我們沒有耽誤到你的計畫吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.02,0:13:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,像是跟學長見面之類的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.66,0:13:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,喔 我沒約 所以沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.25,0:13:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.73,0:13:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,宵 你去神戶之後跟學長見過幾次面
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.34,0:13:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,他有來店裡吃過咖哩 所以是一次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.92,0:13:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,一次
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.88,0:13:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 你說他來店裡吃咖哩
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.63,0:13:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,那不就只見到一個小時左右
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.11,0:13:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 應該吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.04,0:13:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣不行啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.10,0:13:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 學長好可憐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.95,0:14:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,固執的女生真的很難搞
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.99,0:14:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,可…可是我也有自己的事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.06,0:14:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我們有約下次要開章魚燒派對
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.32,0:14:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,可是那也是學長約你的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.99,0:14:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,咦 嗯 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.20,0:14:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,宵 你就不能再積極一點嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.43,0:14:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,對啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.58,0:14:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你還搞了那個契約 王子殿下也真能忍
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.92,0:14:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,她們說的也有道理
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.92,0:14:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,因為我的關係 我們才沒怎麼見面
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.14,0:14:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,或許我該再主動一點
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.16,0:14:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,而且…我也想多見學長幾次
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.90,0:14:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然真的是我自己的問題…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.14,0:14:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,總覺得最近好像隨時都知道他在哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.29,0:14:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.80,0:14:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.49,0:14:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 對了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.61,0:15:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你上次寫作業時吃的那個零食有帶嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.01,0:15:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,有帶 出新口味了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.76,0:15:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.85,0:15:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 你們兩個可以先走嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.69,0:15:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,對了 我又找到一家好吃的咖哩店
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.75,0:15:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,咦 在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.14,0:15:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,車站大樓的一樓
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.56,0:15:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,喔 我不知道有那家店
Dialogue: 1,0:15:15.56,0:15:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord6\fs40\c&H2D352E&\3c&H99A742&\pos(47.001,67.002)}你還醒著嗎\N{\c&HE5F0DF&\3c&HA0B65C&}訊息已刪除\N{\c&HEBF4DA&\3c&H8EA448&}今天 {\c&H38322D&\3c&HEDEDEA&}\N在你後面 請回頭
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.56,0:15:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\shad0\blur3\p1\fscy220\alpha&H50&\c&HBFE8A4&\3c&HF8D6AE&\4c&HB7775D&}m 0 0 l 330 0 330 96 0 96
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.58,0:15:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,對啊 有點像亞洲咖啡廳的感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.06,0:15:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼 是異國料理嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.27,0:15:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,對
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.49,0:15:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我去上個廁所
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.28,0:15:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.31,0:15:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,喲
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.64,0:15:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,好久不見
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.67,0:15:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.06,0:15:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你…你還好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.05,0:15:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 我很好 宵你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.07,0:15:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.10,0:15:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不過我們前幾天才見過面
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.49,0:15:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,說得也是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.12,0:16:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我得積極一點
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.73,0:16:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,那個
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.73,0:16:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,那個
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.97,0:16:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.66,0:16:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你先說吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.99,0:16:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不 宵你先
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.75,0:16:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,可是我…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.13,0:16:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你不說的話這段對話就沒完沒了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.73,0:16:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,今天放學後要不要去哪裡走走
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.62,0:16:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.78,0:16:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我很樂意
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.29,0:16:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 好開心
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.54,0:16:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,剛好前幾天
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.76,0:16:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我從認識的人那裡聽說了一家很好吃的甜點店
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.93,0:16:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,那叫什麼來著 你知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.87,0:16:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,就是把小蛋糕放在盤子上的那種
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.90,0:16:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,名字聽起來像…動畫之類的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.90,0:16:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs42\pos(1077.333,975)}Animation
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.52,0:16:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你是指下午茶嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.52,0:16:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs42\pos(1014,975)}Afternoon Tea
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.52,0:16:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,對 就是那個
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.84,0:16:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,天才
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.84,0:16:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.86,0:16:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,太美了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.43,0:16:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,他是不是很愛這樣稱讚我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.46,0:17:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,只有開頭的A一樣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.79,0:17:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,總之我們放學後見
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.85,0:17:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.72,0:17:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.25,0:17:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我已經告訴她我的心意了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.23,0:17:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.97,0:17:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,好時髦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.66,0:17:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不過好多人在排隊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.73,0:17:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,看來真的是人氣店家
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.39,0:17:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,好…好熱
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.45,0:17:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,學…學長你還好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.95,0:17:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,對了 他很怕熱
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.79,0:17:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,還好 還好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.51,0:17:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,只是排一下隊而已吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.62,0:18:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,小意思
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.68,0:18:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你的臉色很差
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.38,0:18:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我不要
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.31,0:18:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,好不容易能跟你約會 我才不要回家
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.93,0:18:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你是小孩子嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.71,0:18:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,那 我們外帶好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.66,0:18:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,要在哪裡吃
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.03,0:18:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,公園…會很熱
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.79,0:18:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,卡…卡拉OK包廂
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.56,0:18:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 圖書館不能吃東西…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.26,0:18:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,今天沒帶陽傘…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.97,0:18:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.94,0:18:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,要來我家嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.63,0:18:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.10,0:18:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我不會勉強你啦 不過…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.39,0:18:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,去學長…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.87,0:18:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,家裡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.79,0:18:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,那不就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.78,0:18:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,在開章魚燒派對之前 就先往前邁進一步了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.65,0:18:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我要積極一點
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.95,0:19:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我…我過去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.57,0:19:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,打…打擾了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.82,0:19:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我馬上把桌子拿過來
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.26,0:19:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡是學長的房間
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.61,0:19:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,空蕩蕩的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.66,0:19:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,男生的房間都是這種感覺嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.00,0:19:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,喔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.55,0:19:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,宵 你坐這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.06,0:19:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.38,0:19:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,因為我沒有坐墊之類的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.90,0:19:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,可是那是你的棉被吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.90,0:19:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我不在意
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.25,0:19:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,可是我在意
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.18,0:19:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那 這樣如何
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.51,0:19:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,變成兩個人都坐在棉被上了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.13,0:19:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼要讓自己更緊張啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.26,0:19:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那 我們開動吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.80,0:19:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 對 我們開動吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.55,0:20:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然我很喜歡甜食
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.28,0:20:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,可是太緊張了 不知道吞不吞得下去
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.64,0:20:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了 你還好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.49,0:20:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.32,0:20:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,茶比我想像中還燙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.61,0:20:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你燙到了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.16,0:20:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,讓我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.98,0:20:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 不用 我沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.83,0:20:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你不用那麼提防我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.97,0:20:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是擔心你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.32,0:20:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不…不是那樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.93,0:20:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,只是…我覺得我快不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.43,0:20:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我的心臟已經快要爆炸了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.67,0:20:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,學…長
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.63,0:21:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.26,0:21:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,接下來會進行到哪一步
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.95,0:21:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,學長
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.09,0:21:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,那個 怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.22,0:21:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,欸 宵
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.50,0:21:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟你打工地方的那個男的 發生什麼事了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.86,0:21:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你…怎麼會知道
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.47,0:22:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(529,412)\fs54\c&H39211F&\bord0\b1\t(4448,4860,\c&HFFFFFF&)\frz20.45\pos(1020.003,643.995)}空無一物的房間
